    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A burst of frost erupts from you, filling a 15-foot Emanation. Each creature you choose in the area makes a Constitution saving throw. On a failure, a creature takes 2d6 Cold damage and has the &amp;Reference[restrained apply=false]{Restrained} condition until the end of your next turn. On a success, it only takes half as much damage.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong> The damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 1.</p>",
